{"story":{"id":"story-5dd780be99cbd8e2","title":{"zh":"不行就是不行","en":"No Means No"},"category":"society","image":"art/49238b3a2ea53b060771.webp","start":"first_contact.1165","chapters":1,"nodes":1,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"第二次拒绝[This.ContactCountry.GetName]让我们前往他们的舰船的邀请得到了情绪激烈的回复。我们收到了一份来自多名外星船员长达数个小时的通讯，我们的[This.Owner.GetLinguists]认为他们似乎是在因我们的不愿出息而发出谴责。\n\n这些通信，加上从他们船上截获的信号，使我们能够破译足够多他们的语言以产生有意义的理解。尽管他们对这一事件持消极态度，但我们现在可以建立更适当的外交关系了。","en":"The second rejection by the [This.ContactCountry.GetName] to invite us to their ship was met with a strong emotional response. We received communication from multiple alien crew members for several hours, in what our [This.Owner.GetLinguists] believe was an at"},"navigation":{"order":["first_contact.1165"],"tree":[{"id":"first_contact.1165","parent":null,"depth":0,"kind":"reading","label":{"zh":"","en":""}}],"links":[]}},"chapters":[{"id":"first_contact.1165","title":{"zh":"不行就是不行","en":"No Means No"},"texts":[{"zh":"第二次拒绝[This.ContactCountry.GetName]让我们前往他们的舰船的邀请得到了情绪激烈的回复。我们收到了一份来自多名外星船员长达数个小时的通讯，我们的[This.Owner.GetLinguists]认为他们似乎是在因我们的不愿出息而发出谴责。\n\n这些通信，加上从他们船上截获的信号，使我们能够破译足够多他们的语言以产生有意义的理解。尽管他们对这一事件持消极态度，但我们现在可以建立更适当的外交关系了。","en":"The second rejection by the [This.ContactCountry.GetName] to invite us to their ship was met with a strong emotional response. We received communication from multiple alien crew members for several hours, in what our [This.Owner.GetLinguists] believe was an attempt to guilt us for not attending.\n\nThese communications, along with intercepted signals from their ship, have allowed us to decipher enough of their language to have a working understanding. We can now initiate more appropriate diplomatic connections, although they have taken this initial incident negatively."}],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":"art/49238b3a2ea53b060771.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"这些外星人可真顽固。","en":"These aliens are persistent."},"conditional":false,"next":[]}],"next":[{"target":"first_contact